WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.000
Riga, in Latvia, is hosting the 4th Summit
of the Eastern Partnership.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.740
It's the meeting of the European Union with
its 6 neighbours to the east: Ukraine, Belarus,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.429
the Republic of Moldova, Georgia, Armenia
and Azerbaijan. Since their last summit in

00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:21.650
Vilnius the context has changed dramatically
with the conflict in Ukraine.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:28.650
"We cannot escape from the sad reality of
the conflict and the daily loss of lives.

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:35.200
Security in Europe is at stake here. The EU
wants to offer more political and economic

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.920
cooperation to its Eastern partners.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:46.300
"You have friends in Europe. You can be sure
that me, personally, and your other friends,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.640
we will be very consistent and very loyal."

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:55.470
The Eastern Partnership is an offer of the
EU to its 6 neighbours. More economic support,

00:00:55.470 --> 00:01:01.160
better administrations, modern transport and
energy networks, in exchange for democratic reform.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:09.100
"Reform must continue, it must be credible,
it must be swift, it must be sustained.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.900
You keep reforming, and we will keep supporting."

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:19.880
Results are tangible. Take mobility. It’s
essential, especially for youngsters.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.280
With EU help, Moldova has passed drastic new laws
and introduced biometric passports.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:33.159
Travel to the EU is now visa-free. Georgia and Ukraine
are working on it, but are not there yet.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:39.530
The EU takes a one-by-one approach with its
6 Partners, each of them at its own pace.

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:45.700
With Belarus the focus is on human rights,
with Azerbaijan also on energy.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:51.240
With Ukraine, Moldova and Georgia, the EU
last year signed Association agreements with

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:56.770
important trade parts. Products from these
three countries can now be sold on the EU

00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:03.770
market without custom tax. For example: Georgia
increased its exports to the EU by 50%,

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:08.200
and European companies are starting to invest there.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:13.400
With Armenia the situation is different. As
the country decided to join the Eurasian Economic

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:19.579
Union sponsored by Russia, the EU is exploring
how trade relations can be organised,

00:02:19.579 --> 00:02:21.549
in full respect of Armenia's choice.

00:02:21.549 --> 00:02:27.980
Let me say very clearly .... there is no way
that our partnership with our eastern partners

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:34.189
and countries can be perceived as confrontational,
on the contrary.... It was really clear in

00:02:34.189 --> 00:02:41.189
the beginning and it is very clear now that
the door to cooperation is always open,

00:02:41.189 --> 00:02:42.819
also for Russia.

00:02:42.819 --> 00:02:48.340
Reform of the police and judiciary is crucial.
The dramatic killing of peaceful demonstrators

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:54.829
on Maidan Square in Kiev cannot happen again.
Citizens must be able to trust their security forces.

00:02:54.829 --> 00:02:59.909
This is why these Ukrainian policemen are
now being trained by European colleagues on

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:05.930
how to handle different situations. Similar
trainings will be organised in Moldova, where

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:11.620
the institutions are still fragile.
"We want to assist Moldova in building resilience

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:19.200
to the outside and building trust at home.
An issue we will discuss further at the Eastern

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:23.620
Partnership Summit in Riga".
Leaders from the Eastern partnership countries

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:27.730
will meet in the Castle of Light, Latvia's
brand new national library on the Eastern

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.229
bank of the river Daugava.

